# Online 1v1 battle — Supabase Realtime backend (optional).
#
# When these are set, battles connect over Supabase Realtime so two different
# devices/browsers can play together. When unset, the app falls back to a
# BroadcastChannel transport that only connects multiple tabs of the SAME
# browser (handy for local testing).
#
# Both values are public/browser-safe (the anon key is designed to ship in the
# client). Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your project's values, and add
# the same vars to your Vercel / GitHub Pages build environment.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
